# Vue frontend (`wsjtx-web-ui`)

- Real app entry: `App.vue` → `HomeView` → `BandActivity` / `ControlPanel` / `WaterfallDisplay`.
- State and WS live in `src/stores/wsjtx.ts`. Types in `src/types/ws.ts` (mirror `pkg/wsjtx/wsjson.go` / `docs/protocol.md`).
- Named wire types: `status`, `decode`, `audioDevices`; commands: `reply`, `halt`, `getAudioDevices`, `setAudioDevice`. Never reintroduce `"1"` / `"2"`.
- Vite build writes to `../dist` for Go embed. Dev: `npm run dev` on `:5173` (proxies `/ws` → `:8080`).
- Do not add new heavy Node deps without need; long-term direction may leave the SPA (see frontend migration todo).
